States
{
Spawn:
1H24 A 0
1H24 B 1
1H24 A 1
Goto Spawn+2
See:
1H24 BCDE 5
Goto Spawn
Missile:
1H24 FG 6
goto Spawn+2
ClassPain: 1H24 H 0
Goto MegamanPain

ClassDeath:
1H24 H 0
goto MegamanDeath
MegamanDeath0:
1H24 H 19 A_JumpIfInventory("CriticalDeath",1,"MegamanGib")
