1H24 H 0 A_SpawnItemEx("TangoGirlCatAttackDeath",0,0,12,28,0,5,0,1)
TNT1 A 1
Goto MegamanErase
MegamanCorpse:
1H24 Z 0 A_SpawnItemEx("Corpse_24",0,0,0,momx,momy,momz,0,9)
Goto MegamanGib
}
}
